	(property "Design notes" "500 mA slow fuse, matching the TMR 1 recommended 5 V input fuse. 125 VAC/DC, 50 A interrupt at 125 V; 300 A at 32 VDC. Nominal cold resistance 0.700 ohm; I2t 0.240 A2s is nominal, not a startup coordination guarantee. Selected footprint pads match the 452/454 recommended 1.96 x 3.15 mm lands, 2.95 mm inner gap. Use an SMD adapter for perfboard."
